<title>NETHERLANDS: NBM-Amstelland 96 net profit Dfl 81.5 mln.</title>
<headline>NBM-Amstelland 96 net profit Dfl 81.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.85 vs   2.38</p>
<p>    Net profit			    81.5  vs  40.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.10 vs   0.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected construction firm NBM-Amstelland NV to report a net profit of between 70 and 83 million guilders.</p>
</text>
